# ---- Secrets (never commit) ---------------------------------------------
# Local-dev configuration is inline in dev_env/docker-compose.local.yml —
# no .env files are used here. The patterns below are a defence-in-depth
# net: if anyone accidentally introduces an env-file anywhere in the tree
# (including dev_env/), it stays uncommitted.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# ---- .NET ----------------------------------------------------------------
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.vs/

# ---- Node / Angular ------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# ---- IDEs / OS junk ------------------------------------------------------
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.history/

# ---- Angular CLI cache ---------------------------------------------------
# Created on first `ng build`; must never be committed.
**/.angular/

# ---- Playwright runtime artifacts ----------------------------------------
# Generated per-test-run under testing/e2e/. None of this is source.
testing/e2e/test-results/
testing/e2e/playwright-report/
testing/e2e/.playwright/
testing/e2e/blob-report/
**/playwright/.cache/

# ---- Code coverage / test runners ----------------------------------------
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/junit*.xml
**/test-results*.xml

# ---- Terraform (state must never live in the repo, per devops-engineer
#       spec — state lives in Azure Storage) -------------------------------
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/crash.log

# ---- Misc ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
